---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'
import PlatformTable from '../components/PlatformTable.astro'
import WaitlistForm from '../components/WaitlistForm.astro'
import Faq from '../components/Faq.astro'
import { release } from '../data/release'
---

<BaseLayout
  title="下载 Dex AGENT v0.2.1 · Windows"
  description="Dex AGENT v0.2.1 Windows x64 公共预览版下载。安装包自带本地运行环境，首次启动自动初始化。"
  current="/download/"
  schema
>
  <section class="dl2-hero">
    <div class="container dl2-hero-inner">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">DOWNLOAD / v0.2.1 / RELEASE 001</p>
        <h1>把回路<br />装进你的桌面。</h1>
        <p>
          Windows 公共预览版已开放下载。安装包自带本地运行环境，首次启动会初始化 dsh
          profile；模型 Key 由你在应用内填写。
        </p>
        <div class="actions" style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:22px;margin-top:28px;flex-wrap:wrap">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href={release.downloadUrl}>下载 Windows 版</a>
          <a class="text-link" href={release.releaseUrl}>查看发布说明 ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="order-card" aria-label="版本状态">
        <span class="stamp2">PUBLIC PREVIEW</span>
        <div class="orow"><span>VERSION</span><b>{release.version}</b></div>
        <div class="orow"><span>CHANNEL</span><b>{release.channel}</b></div>
        <div class="orow"><span>PLATFORM</span><b>WINDOWS X64</b></div>
        <div class="orow"><span>DISTRIBUTION</span><b>{release.size} · UNSIGNED</b></div>
        <div class="orow"><span>DATA</span><b>LOCAL-FIRST</b></div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="dl2-body">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="dl2-head">
        <div class="fig">FIG. D1</div>
        <h2>选择你的平台。</h2>
        <p>Windows x64 已可下载；macOS / Linux 仍在准备中。</p>
      </div>
      <PlatformTable />
      <div class="dl2-note">
        <i></i>
        <p>
          当前安装包未做代码签名，Windows SmartScreen 可能提示“未知发布者”。请核对
          SHA-256：<span class="mono">{release.sha256}</span>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="dl2-note">
        <i></i>
        <p>
          自包含版会占用约 {release.installedSize} 磁盘空间；首次启动需要复制本地运行时，
          请预留约 2 GiB 可用空间。安装包不包含任何模型凭据，安装后在「设置 → 模型」中填写。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="dl2-body" id="waitlist">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="dl2-head">
        <div class="fig">FIG. D2</div>
        <h2>macOS / Linux 预约。</h2>
        <p>Windows 已开放；其他平台准备好后，我们会通过邮件联系你。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="wait2">
        <div>
          <h3>留下一个能联系到你的地址。</h3>
          <p>只用于平台开放通知，不进入营销名单。当前表单使用 mailto: 占位，站点接入真实表单端点后会直接提交。</p>
          <div class="get-list">
            <div><b>01 / WINDOWS</b><span>已开放 · 直接下载</span></div>
            <div><b>02 / MACOS</b><span>预约通知</span></div>
            <div><b>03 / LINUX</b><span>预约通知</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <WaitlistForm />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="dl2-body" id="faq">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="dl2-head">
        <div class="fig">FIG. D3</div>
        <h2>常见问题。</h2>
        <p>关于安装、运行时、数据与平台。</p>
      </div>
      <Faq />
      <div class="dl2-note">
        <i></i>
        <p>
          校验和文件：<a class="text-link" href={release.checksumUrl}>SHA-256</a> ·
          安装包大小 {release.size} · 适用 {release.platform}
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
